    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pamlico County, where Bayboro sits, was settled in the early‑eighteenth century by Welsh, Swiss, French, English, and German immigrants, after the Algonquian and Pamlico peoples.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
