      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bayboro’s history includes a 1905 Reel Cotton Gin and a 1915 Grist Mill, two early‑twentieth‑century mills still standing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
