      "source": "https://northcarolinahistory.org/encyclopedia/pamlico-county-1872/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Pamlico County’s tourism thrives on fishing and sailing; the nearby town of Oriental hosts the annual Oriental Regatta, a popular boat race.",
